# ── .NET build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These were committed to this repository at some point (a full Debug/net6.0 MelonLoader
# build of the original desktop mod). They are now ignored so a stale binary can never be
# mistaken for — or silently substituted into — a fresh build.
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.deps.json
*.cache
*.FileListAbsolute.txt

# ── The port keeps its deliverables on purpose ──────────────────────────────────────
!StArray-Port/Build/*.dll

# ── Staged reference assemblies (fetched by CI from the StArray release) ─────────────
StArray-Port/lib/

# ── Unity / IDE / OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
